  "text": "Special\nOffers\n\nNeed a closer look? Buy a sample\nColor\n\nDesert Sunrise\nBeige Base with Red and Sand Tones\n\nDesert Sunrise Inside Corner\n18\" x 22.5\" or 2.81 SQFT\n\nHome Faux Stone Panels Desert Sunrise Desert Sunrise Inside Corner\nThe 90° inside corner piece is unique to the GenStone system. This panel eliminates the need to miter panels when you need to transition through an inside corner. Like the outside corner panel, this piece also creates the necessary offset pattern throughout the install. The positive shiplap edge runs along the left side of the panel and the negative shiplap edge follows the right side. Each shiplap is designed to provide a tight connection to panels joined to its right and left.\n\n$ 64.99 each\n\n- Desert Sunrise Inside Corner quantity +\nAdd to cart\n\nCalculator Project SOS\n\n+276 pictures\n\nGet everything you need\n\nGuides & Downloads\n\nReviews\nProduct Knowledge\nSpecs\n\nThe 90° inside corner piece is unique to the GenStone system. This panel eliminates the need to miter panels when you need to transition through an inside corner. Like the outside corner panel, this piece also creates the necessary offset pattern throughout the install. The positive shiplap edge runs along the left side of the panel and the negative shiplap edge follows the right side. Each shiplap is designed to provide a tight connection to panels joined to its right and left.",
